322	     * Handles {@link DuplicateHouseholdException} raised when a create request supplies a
323	     * last name and address already used by another owner (compared case-insensitively with
324	     * collapsed whitespace) without opting in via {@code sharesHousehold}. Returns a 409
325	     * Conflict whose body carries an {@code errors} array naming the {@code lastName} and
326	     * {@code address} fields.
327	     *
328	     * @param e The {@link DuplicateHouseholdException} to be handled
329	     * @param request {@link HttpServletRequest} object referring to the current request.
330	     * @return A {@link ResponseEntity} containing the error information and a 409 Conflict status.
331	     */
