347	     * Handles {@link CityAtCapacityException} raised when a create request supplies a
348	     * {@code city} that already contains the maximum number of owners (compared
349	     * case-insensitively). Returns a 409 Conflict whose body carries an {@code errors}
350	     * array naming the {@code city} field.
